C3. Rank-matched controls
==============================================================================
  A club only gains from managing the clock for a man it expects to hold
  six years. If the line is being managed, the effect must be LARGER for
  those men than for men the incentive does not reach.

  round 1 pick                             n   87  ratio 2.126  CI 0.424-10.660  z=0.92  p=0.3592
  rounds 1-5                               n  216  ratio 0.990  CI 0.430-2.277  z=-0.02  p=0.9806
  round 6+ / no draft record               n  281  ratio 1.239  CI 0.609-2.518  z=0.59  p=0.5545
  award tier A or B (prior seasons)        n  143  ratio 0.988  CI 0.358-2.728  z=-0.02  p=0.9817
  age at debut <= 23                       n   85  ratio 0.933  CI 0.258-3.370  z=-0.11  p=0.9155
  age at debut 27 or older                 n   47  ratio 8.301  CI 0.274-251.121  z=1.22  p=0.2238
  INCENTIVE PRESENT (young + pedigree)     n  116  ratio 1.106  CI 0.379-3.226  z=0.18  p=0.8541
  INCENTIVE ABSENT (age 27+)               n   47  ratio 8.301  CI 0.274-251.121  z=1.22  p=0.2238

==============================================================================
C4. Roster need
==============================================================================
  A club with an injury promotes when it must. IL placements by the
  promoting club in the 21 days before the promotion, taken from the wire
  and read at the arriving man’s own side of the roster: the position is
  named inside the sentence, so no second pull was needed.

  no same-side IL placement in 21 days     n  204  ratio 0.472  CI 0.180-1.240  z=-1.52  p=0.1277
  at least one same-side placement         n  630  ratio 1.553  CI 1.007-2.397  z=1.99  p=0.0465

  mean same-side IL placements in the prior 21 days: before the line 2.26 (n=155), after 1.64 (n=679)
  difference 0.63 placements, t=3.78, p=0.0002
  Roster need is HIGHER before the line, not lower. A club promoting in the
  first ten days of a season is answering an injury, which is the ordinary
  reason to promote early and is the opposite of holding a man back. The
  control therefore works against the clock reading rather than for it.

